# Project configuration

## Tech Stack
- React 19
- TypeScript 5.9 strict mode
- Vite 8
- Cake& v4.2.4
- styled-components
- Tauri 2 (local Windows-app shell; Electron kept as an alternative)
- Vitest and Testing Library

## Critical Patterns & Conventions
- Import Cake& exports from `@cake-admin/cakeand`.
- Mount exactly one `CakeProvider`.
- Import Cake& CSS before local styles.
- Use explicit file extensions for relative imports.
- Keep presentation components independent of typed mock fixtures.
- Use semantic HTML and native controls where Cake& has no primitive.

## Changelog
- Added a local Electron Windows-app launch path (`npm run start:windows`) with frameless chrome and live caption controls.
- Moved `npm run start:windows` to a Tauri shell rendering through the OS webview, behind one shared desktop window API.
- Completed the Figma-accurate Vantage Ampersand Phase 1 Home prototype with Cake& components, tokenized Mica styling, interactions, scenario states, and automated accessibility validation.
